---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import heroHeadshot from '../assets/hero-headshot.webp';
---

<section class="hero-section">
	<div class="text">
		<h1>Hello from Andrius 👋🏾</h1>
		<p>I'm a Senior iOS Engineer with 9+ years of experience specializing in Swift, UIKit, Core Data, and app architecture. Great apps aren't just functional — they should feel natural, be accessible to everyone, and meet both simple and complex user needs.</p>

		<p>Most recently, I spent 8 years at Pipedrive setting technical direction for a five-person iOS team, modernizing persistence and sync, and shipping features like offline search and PKCE web authentication. Based in Tallinn, I'm currently open to Senior iOS and hands-on Technical Lead roles, locally or remotely.</p>

		<p>Outside of iOS engineering, I enjoy tinkering with web development, productivity tools, touch typing, and content creation. Feel free to look around — happy to connect!</p>
		<div class="links">
			<a href="#experience">
				<i class="fa-solid fa-code"></i>
				<span>Experience</span>
			</a>
			<a href="#contact">
				<i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i>
				<span>Contact</span>
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="headshot">
		<Image
			src={heroHeadshot}
			alt="Andrius Shiaulis - Senior iOS Developer"
			width={320}
			height={320}
			densities={[1, 2]}
			quality={85}
			loading="eager"
			fetchpriority="high"
		/>
	</div>
</section>
